  "notes": [
    "Adjustment procedure: 1) Attach housing [8] to the support with bolt [9], nut [10] and screw [17] loose. 2) Run bumper screw [12] (bumper [13] installed) fully down. 3) Close the lid so pin [1] enters bushing [11]; this locates housing [8]. 4) Tighten [10] and [17] to spec. 5) Back screw [12] up until the bumper seats firmly against the underside of the lid."
  ],
